    "title": "Unifying Quantum Magic: A Field-Theoretic Framework for Many-Body Non-Gaussianity",
    "excerpt": "A rigorous scholarly analysis exploring the fundamental mathematical physics, quantum formulations, and transformative implications of Unifying Quantum Magic: A Field-Theoretic Framework for Many-Body Non-Gaussianity.",
    "readingTime": "12 min read",
